<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 10px; font-variant-ligatures: none; height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;Use points to book your next flight directly from your Business Rewards account&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><b style="">Redeem flights right from your Qantas Business Rewards account<br></b><br><span style="font-size: 14px;">Hi &lt; AM to Insert personalisation &gt;,</span></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Good news, it's now even easier to use your Qantas Points with Qantas Business Rewards.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">If you’re looking to book a Classic Flight Reward or use Points Plus Pay - Flights, you can now book using your business’s points, directly from your Qantas Business Rewards account.^</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Unlock even more value from your membership.<br></span></font><ul style=""><li><b style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Save on business expenses:</b><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"> redeem your existing points balance on your next business flight.^</span></li><li style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><b>Save time:</b> it’s now faster to book flights using points. Simply log into your Qantas Business Rewards account to begin your flight search. You no longer need to transfer the points from your business account to a Qantas Frequent Flyer.</span></font></li><li style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><b>You’re in control: </b>view all flight options and combine Classic Flight Rewards with Member Deal fares when booking your next flight.</span></font></li><li style=""><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><b>Enjoy choice:</b> redeem your points for Classic Flight Reward~ seats on Qantas or Jetstar or use Points Plus Pay** across Qantas, Jetstar and selected partner airlines.</span></font></li></ul></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Points can still be transferred (a minimum of 3,000) from your Qantas Business Rewards account to any Qantas Frequent Flyer account to redeem a range of rewards, including flight upgrades, hotels, car hire, wine and items from the Qantas Rewards Store.&gt;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><font color="#ff0000">&lt;dynamic&gt; show content block to non-product only&nbsp;</font></span><br><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><b style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Maximise your membership</b><br><br><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">To earn points for your business± on every Qantas flight ensure all your travellers add your ABN and their Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number to every Qantas flight booking made. That way, both your business and the traveller will earn rewards for flying.*&nbsp;<br></span></font><br><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">&lt;end&gt;</span><br><br><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">Learn more about how to use your points to make your next flight booking </span><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/use-points.html" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;">here</a><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><font color="#666666">. </font><br><br><font color="#ff0000">&lt;dynamic CTA&gt;&nbsp;</font><br><br><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/flight-search" style=""><font color="#666666">Book Flights &gt;</font></a> <span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); white-space: pre;">	</span><font color="#666666">SHOW IF PTS &gt; 5000&nbsp;</font><br><font color="#666666"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html"><font color="#666666">Learn More &gt;</font></a> </font><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); white-space: pre;">	</span><font color="#666666">SHOW IF PTS &lt; 5000<br></font></span><font color="#666666"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none;"><br><div style="text-align: center;"><b>Ready to fly - find out more&nbsp;</b></div><div style="text-align: center;"><br></div></span></font><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="20" cellspacing="0" id="emailBody" table-layout="fixed" width="600px" style="font-family: Ciutadella, Arial; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px;"><thead align="center" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><tr><th align="center" bgcolor="#D20000" colspan="1" style="background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 200px;">How many points do I need?</th><th align="center" bgcolor="#D20000" colspan="1" style="background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 200px;">Earn rewards with Points Plus Pay</th><th align="center" bgcolor="#D20000" colspan="1" style="background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 200px;">Fly with confidence</th></tr></thead><tbody align="center"><tr><td align="center" valign="top" colspan="1" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 200px;"><font color="#666666">Save on business expenses with Classic Flight Rewards~ starting from as little as 6,400 points on Jetstar and 8,000 points on Qantas excluding taxes, fees and carrier charges.</font></td><td align="center" valign="top" colspan="1" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 200px;"><font color="#666666">Use the combination of points and cash that suits you best, plus enjoy more choice and flexibility by choosing your preferred travel times and earn Qantas Points and Status Credits for both the business<span style="font-size: 11px; bottom: 1ex; vertical-align: 1px; position: relative;">±</span>&nbsp;and the traveller*.</font></td><td align="center" valign="top" colspan="1" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 200px;"><font color="#666666">With contactless check in options, onboard hygiene kits, sanitising stations in lounges and more, our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-updates/coronavirus/health-while-flying.html"><font color="#666666">Fly Well</font></a> program brings together a number of wellbeing measures to give you peace-of-mind at each point of your journey.</font></td></tr></tbody></table><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font color="#666666"><font color="#666666"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" style=""><font color="#666666">Login and learn more &gt;</font></a>&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;</font><br><br><b style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Have any questions?&nbsp;</b><br><font color="#666666">To speak with one of our specialised consultants, call our dedicated Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78 from Monday to Friday (7am-7pm AEST).</font><br><br><font color="#666666">Kind regards,&nbsp;</font><br><br></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">{!User.Title}</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><i>Qantas Airways Limited</i></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 40px; height: 42px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 600px; border: 0px; width: 600px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 22px 0px 0px; height: 45px; border: 0px;"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" styl